<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάλληλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set over against one
				another, correspondent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					905b8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.9.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσει ἅμα κατάλληλα τελειοῦται:
				διὸ καὶ ἀκούει τε ἅμα καὶ φωνεῖ</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παιδία</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				902a11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα κ. τῷ στόματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κεῖσθαι</span> to be
				<i>parallel</i>, of lines, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				3.100
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ</span>. the
				<i>corresponding states</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.238
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Th.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ. τῆς διανοίας</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασίαι δόγμασι κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				7.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς στρατιωτικοῖς ἔργοις
					καταλληλότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					71.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>appropriate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ κατὰ φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.9.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				4.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ὑγίειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					5.8
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως, κ. λέγεσθαι</span> prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀλλήλων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1041a33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῇ φύσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.22.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>rightly constructed, congruent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>, al.; also, <i>well-arranged, in good order</i>, of the
			text of Aristotle, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				172.13
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				37.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one after another, in succession</i>, neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάλληλα</span>, as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.5.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.31.5
			</span></i>; <i>in a row</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτὰ κεφαλὰς
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.6.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληφθέντα κατάλληλα</span> taken
				<i>in corresponding order</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				5.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
